  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il évite agilement les attaques ennemies\net crache des boules de feu par le groin.\nIl aime griller des Baies pour les manger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can deftly dodge its foe’s attacks\nwhile shooting fireballs from its nose.\nIt roasts berries before it eats them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il crache du feu par le groin.\nMais quand il est enrhumé, seule\nune fumée noirâtre en sort.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It blows fire through its nose.\nWhen it catches a cold, the fire\nbecomes pitch-black smoke instead.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It loves to eat roasted berries,\nbut sometimes it gets too excited\nand burns them to a crisp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It loves to eat roasted berries,\nbut sometimes it gets too excited\nand burns them to a crisp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきの　こうげきを　みがるに　よけて\nはなから　ひのたまを　うちだす。\nほのおで　きのみを　やいて　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "적의 공격을 가볍게 피하고\n코로 불구슬을 쏘아댄다.\n불꽃으로 나무열매를 구워 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il évite agilement les attaques ennemies et crache\ndes boules de feu par le groin. Il aime griller des\nBaies pour les manger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Weicht flink gegnerischen Angriffen aus und schießt\nFlammen aus dem Rüssel, mit denen es gern auch\nmal Nüsse röstet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evita con agilidad los ataques enemigos. Lanza bolas\nde fuego por su hocico y tuesta bayas del bosque para\ncomer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lancia palle di fuoco dal naso mentre evita abilmente\ngli attacchi del nemico. Mangia bacche che arrostisce\nlui stesso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can deftly dodge its foe’s attacks while shooting\nfireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it\neats them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵の　攻撃を　身軽に　避けて\n鼻から　火の玉を　撃ち出す。\n炎で　木の実を　焼いて　食べる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evita con agilidad los ataques enemigos. Lanza bolas\nde fuego por su hocico y tuesta bayas del bosque para\ncomer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "やいた　きのみを　たべるのが\nだいすきだが　こうふんしすぎて\nときどき　まっくろこげに　しちゃう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "구운 나무열매를 먹는 것을\n매우 좋아하지만 너무 흥분해서\n가끔 새까맣게 태워버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il adore se goinfrer de Baies grillées, mais il lui arrive\nde les réduire en cendres dans son excitation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Floink liebt es, selbst geröstete Nüsse zu verspeisen.\nAb und zu verkohlt es sie jedoch ungewollt vor lauter\nVorfreude.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encanta comer bayas tostadas, pero a veces se\nemociona demasiado y termina churruscándolas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Adora mangiare le bacche arrostite, ma a volte si fa\nprendere la mano per l’eccitazione e le riduce in\ncenere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it\ngets too excited and burns them to a crisp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
